  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HIV and AIDS prevention in the Magdalena Medio</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Since 1995, Corporaci&#xF3;n de Desarrollo y Paz del Magdalena Medio (CDPMM) has been working with state, international and private sector partners to implement strategies that seek to guarantee the exercise and fulfilment of human rights, including prevention of HIV and AIDS and gender based violence in Colombia.

CDPMM&#x2019;s work in alliance with ECOPETROL and the Ministry of Education has been one of its most important project interventions in the region. It is currently based on the following elements; promoting the exercise of human rights in educational institutions from 31 municipalities of Magdalena Medio

In the current cycle (April 2015 - March 2018) CAFOD is supporting CDPMM&apos;s focus on educational institutes and local authorities that seeks to promote the exercise of human rights through the implementation of an obligatory student social service and the provision of support to local authorities in the prevention of HIV and AIDS.</narrative>
  </description>
